  m_Name: A7_X3_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: "It seems like being a Sustainer is quite dangerous and a huge responsibility.
      What if I don\u2019t become their successor and leave it to someone else who
      would be a better fit?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I don\u2019t think you have a choice in this matter. Normally the Sustainer
      will choose a pupil and mentor them for a few years."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The dimensional principles need to be upheld or all the universes will
      face danger. The Sustainer ensures that the dimensions do not collide. The
      last Sustainer has kept us safe for a long time but she disappeared not long
      ago.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4012a7de0e9dff247a457e9e5ceb9797, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
